#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0006 expect=skipped domain=AE
#note "PLAN-function-surface-wave1 phase 2 (a1): the study has no DM dataset. The rule declares All_Or_None [USUBJID, DM.USUBJID] (the join-key authoring gate), so with USUBJID present and DM.USUBJID absent the rule SKIPs by requirement before dy(--DTC, DM.RFSTDTC) is evaluated. AEDY is deliberately wrong on row 1 so that an EXECUTE would be visible as a finding, never as a silent pass."
dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AESEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col AEDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Collection"
col AEDY type=Num label="Study Day of Collection"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 1 | 2014-01-05 | 99
---
